I wrote the rewritten section to `agent-work/rewrite/3.3.md`. It is the only file I created. I did not check the length against the ~5645-character target, and I did not verify the rewrite again.

The section keeps the original heading and the estimator list, and it adds seven recipes (A–G), one per question type. Each recipe has a worked example taken from the question pack, with its arithmetic spelled out and the answer key's result. The section also keeps the true/false traps.

